What's new in this update:

• Open a file straight from the chat: tap a file an agent mentions and it opens on your phone, even if it lives in another folder on your PC.
• A much better file viewer: Markdown that looks like it does on GitHub, PDFs, animated GIFs, SVGs and pinch-to-zoom images.
• Conversations now pick up work you did in the agent's own app on your PC.
• Replies format themselves as they arrive, and nothing an agent said gets replaced anymore.
